        "sentences": [
            [
                "Cindy and Lucy are doing some exercise in the gym.",
                "辛迪和露西正在健身房做运动。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Today I feel ill and have back pain.",
                "「今天我感觉不舒服，背痛。"
            ],
            [
                "I also have strange feelings in my head.",
                "我脑袋里也有种奇怪的感觉。"
            ],
            [
                "I need to rest in that chair.\" Lucy held her head and seemed very tired.",
                "我需要在那把椅子上休息一下。」露西抱着头，看起来非常疲惫。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Your face looks so white.",
                "「你的脸看起来很苍白。"
            ],
            [
                "Are you having a headache?",
                "你是头痛吗？"
            ],
            [
                "And your legs, your feet, they are not in a good condition, right?\" Cindy asked Lucy for more details.",
                "还有你的腿，你的脚，它们状态不太好，对吧？」辛迪向露西询问更多细节。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Exactly!",
                "「没错！"
            ],
            [
                "I didn't sleep well last night, and I had a toothache when I brushed my teeth with my toothbrush this morning.",
                "我昨晚没睡好，今天早上用牙刷刷牙的时候牙痛。"
            ],
            [
                "When I combed my hair, I felt something strange somewhere in my head,\" said Lucy weakly.",
                "我梳头的时候，感觉脑袋里某个地方怪怪的，」露西虚弱地说。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Poor you.",
                "「可怜的你。"
            ],
            [
                "I'm sure that you have got a cold!",
                "我确定你是感冒了！"
            ],
            [
                "You should go to the chemist's to get some medicine.\"",
                "你应该去药店拿些药。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"Yes.",
                "「是的。"
            ],
            [
                "And I think I should do more exercise to keep fit.\"",
                "而且我觉得我应该多做运动来保持健康。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"That's right, Lucy.",
                "「没错，露西。"
            ],
            [
                "We both should do it.",
                "我们都应该这样做。"
            ],
            [
                "To extend(延长) the length of life and improve the quality of life, we should do some outdoor sports, including jogging and bicycling, and so on.",
                "为了延长寿命和提高生活质量，我们应该做一些户外运动，包括慢跑和骑自行车等等。"
            ],
            [
                "We can also do some indoor sports when we're at home, for example, yoga!",
                "我们在家的时候也可以做一些室内运动，比如瑜伽！"
            ],
            [
                "Instead of being lazy, we should keep good habits.\"",
                "我们不应该偷懒，而应该保持好习惯。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"I love yoga, which makes me relaxed from head to toe.",
                "「我喜欢瑜伽，它让我从头到脚都放松。"
            ],
            [
                "In addition, we'd better give up bad habits, like smoking.",
                "此外，我们最好戒掉坏习惯，比如吸烟。"
            ],
            [
                "A lot of people die from smoking every year.\"",
                "每年都有很多人死于吸烟。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"I totally agree with you.",
                "「我完全同意你的看法。"
            ],
            [
                "To keep healthy, it's also important to keep ourselves clean by washing our hands with soap when we come back home from outside.\"",
                "为了保持健康，从外面回家后用肥皂洗手来保持自身清洁也很重要。」"
            ]
        ]
